      "label": "P1：无LLM媒体闭环",
      "deliverables": "媒体状态机Scene/Utterance/UtteranceAdmission/Segment/AudioProduction/TextPresentation与配对状态机StagePairing，复用P0的StopOperation；局部媒体清理；固定许可fixture。",
      "not_required": "通用Task图/Effect全套、云端模型与游戏输入。",
      "criterion": "首段早于EOS；背压、软收尾尾部ACK、UNKNOWN、停止竞争、刷新不重播。"
